                      <p>Note 1:	This clause will be repealed on 1 July 2016. See <ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref> of Schedule 2 to the <i>Tax Laws Amendment (2011 Measures No.</i><i> </i><i>7) Act 2011</i>.</p>
                    </content>
